  - `prism(rings, y0, y1)` extrudes a region (rings, holes wound the other way) into an indexed, watertight mesh. The caps come from three's `ShapeUtils.triangulateShape` (earcut), and each triangle is turned to face outward. So `mesh.ts` imports `three`; the server doesn't import it.
